guide polestar-completionist-alliance/pvp-battlegrounds
title Battleground and world PvP quests (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Miscellaneous
levels 1-60
zone Stormwind City
pitch The battleground and world PvP quests that are done once.

step About this guide
  note These quests ask for battleground or world PvP play. Every step is optional.

